@startuml
title Output & Integration Layer Component Diagram

package "Output & Integration Layer" {
    [Dashboard UI] as UI
    [Agents-api] as AgentsAPI
    database "DB" as AlertsDB
    [Ticketing Connector (ServiceNow)] as TicketingConnector
}

UI --> AgentsAPI : Fetch alerts and actions
AgentsAPI --> AlertsDB : Read stored alerts
AgentsAPI --> TicketingConnector : Send incident creation (future use)
@enduml
